{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_9_level_main_09-10_beg","groupId":"main_9","stageId":"main_09-10","title":"鬼影如潮","storyCode":"9-12","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9ac2877ebef4943ca6c80a6b5908524437e631a7669a4ccc4f7fc7e978204112","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"城中受脏弹轰炸，死伤惨重，罗德岛干员决定在撤离前对当地居民实施救援，简加入了救援队伍。风笛见信使已死，决定穿越城区，回去找号角。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都没事吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了您提醒，我们都及时躲起来了......咳咳咳，小简妮，你呢，还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好，Outcast完全护住了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是外面......发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听到很多人在惨叫......还有孩子们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"简，你还不能出去！所有人，继续趴在掩体附近，尽可能远离门窗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种规模的轰炸不会只有一波——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！我、我的腿......被书架压住了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尔，帮弗雷德一把！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......谢谢，兄弟，我现在能动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有流血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，只有一点点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗包还在吗？拿出急性感染前期阻断剂，立刻服下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？女士，我只是小腿上的皮被木头划破了一块，连骨头都没伤到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在正处于最高级别的感染风险中——看到那块扎破窗户的黑色结晶了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"天、天呐......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员碎纸机","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是活性源石？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说，街上那些黑漆漆的......全部都是？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不敢相信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这岂不是说全城都暴露在巨大的危险中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"该死！女士，我们必须尽快对附近的人们进行紧急救援！时间紧迫，能救一个是一个！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人有意见吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员碎纸机","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......我本来以为有意见的会是奥利弗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"都什么时候了，你还挖苦我！赶紧去收拾急救包啊！弗雷德受伤了，原地待命，负责我们之间的联络！威尔，你赶紧回去看看你的父母——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我也可以和大家一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"别糊涂了！工作有亲人重要？带上足量的药，救完你家人，顺便把你那一条街的邻居都好好检查一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"碎纸机，老朋友，我们得多跑几条街了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了我，奥利弗，我现在也算你手下的临时干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您别开玩笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说正经的，第十区附近交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那里是轰炸中心，最危险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？也请给我一个临时通讯器，我们随时互相通报进度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我也想一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，小简妮，这救援任务不是开玩笑的，你不像我们这样受过专业训练，没必要冒这险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"说到底，谁出的狠毒主意，往人堆里丢活性源石？这都是那帮*维多利亚粗口*暴徒干的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能在极短时间内对这么广的区域狂轰滥炸，策划这场袭击的人，至少投入了超过十门最先进的地面压制榴弹炮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多火炮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我远远看过这两天的战斗。那些被你们称作暴徒的人，他们之中有着很强的术师，这给部队带来了一定隐匿能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——可还远远没到能让他们带着这么多高杀伤性武器进城，且不被驻军发现的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，他们还不至于蠢到用炮口对准好不容易抢下的城区，把当地居民连带着自己人炸得支离破碎吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"简，你知道答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这不可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是想说，我们的人炮轰了城区？！是我们......杀死了这么多平民，还谋划着将数量更多的平民拖入矿石病的深渊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是驻军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"驻军明白这场仗赢不了，因为塔拉出身的人们都在帮另一边。既然无法区分谁才是奸细，他们决定索性将敌人连同平民一网打尽——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而使用脏弹，正是为了绝后患。所有矿石病患者都会被集中管理，这给了驻军借口，他们之后将能堂而皇之地清理塔拉人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......把人命看作取胜的手段？维多利亚的军队，不该保护维多利亚人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很激动，我理解，这正是由于你拥有一颗许多士兵缺乏的仁慈之心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去几百年间，维多利亚军队碾过这片大地上的无数国家与人群，靠的可从来不是仁慈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪，在塔拉居民眼里，暴徒们会是正义的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是只想着利用无辜者性命、为自己谋求利益的组织，不同花样的面具下是同样丑恶麻木的面孔，又有什么区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么——是不是只有罗德岛在做对的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有多么了解罗德岛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信任着奥利弗叔叔他们，而且，从我认识您的第一天起，我就一直信任着您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对我，又了解多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您何必这么严肃，小简妮她需要一点时间来接受......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没关系，奥利弗叔叔，我明白Outcast的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实......很感激你们收留了无处可去的我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也确实，我仍在迷茫......每当我决定站在哪一边的时候，总有人告诉我，我不属于那一边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少在这一刻，我明白自己该做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请让我和你们一起行动。我要尽可能地帮助外面那些受伤的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使，他们中的一部分，刚刚还在朝你丢石头、赶你走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就跟您说的那样，我始终无法对恶行袖手旁观——这和我选择站在哪里没有关系。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥利弗，你听到了？你是小丘郡办事处的负责人，你同意简·薇洛的临时加入吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我没意见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"正好急救品都收拾好了，小简妮，你想和谁一块行动都行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也去中央城区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那就是和Outcast女士一块？呼，我还以为经过刚才那一出，你会有些怕她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员奥利弗","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我什么都没说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然准备好了，大家就各自出发吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记住，保护自己是第一位的——你们既需要做好大面积污染源面前的防护，也需要尽量躲避潜在的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，以目前的情况来看，无论是哪方士兵，都有可能是我们的敌人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G4_victoria_street_d_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厨子先生，厨子先生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，怎么办，到处都是伤员。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我一定要找到厨子先生，他应该就在这附近，我必须把他护送出城！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......欸，什么东西抓住了我的小腿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......敌人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你已经丧失了行动能力。我不该再对你动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......杀了......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先别说话，我帮你把压着腿的这块石头抬起来再说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了！唉，都压烂了啊，而且......这些黑色的结晶......看起来好严重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了......我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能......感染者......肮脏......玷污！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还说这种话做什么？努力活下来不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你......不懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"这比死......更可怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说我不懂就不懂吧。我还要去找人，没办法救你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厨子先生！厨子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又拉我做什么？这......这条围裙！厨子先生——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这块石头，原来还压在了厨子先生身上。难怪我没能找到他。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（情报都还在。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看得出来，最后一刻，厨子先生拼尽全力护住了这些重要的证据。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麦克马丁先生，虽然我也许并不知道您的真名——但我会记住您做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安息吧，我的战友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会让你的英勇白费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有你。我也要谢谢你，不知名的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本该答应你最后的请求，但我看得出来，不需要我动手，你已经快死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有什么话想说吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......领袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到这时候，你心里依旧只想着领袖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......即将......迎来......新生之火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"越来越多的敌人正踏着废墟涌来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人的援军到了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮轰根本没有起到正面作用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长......队长他们会有危险！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须和他们会合——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的任务已经失败了，那么，我们唯一的机会就是夺下通讯基站！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["干员奥利弗"]}]}
